# location-tracking-system

The location tracking system implements multi-layered compliance verification through geolocation services:

## Core Location Verification (Importance Score: 85/100)
Location tracking powered by cascading provider chain with two main components:

1. Primary Location Services
- Hierarchical provider fallback (ipinfo → ipapi)
- Automatic provider switching on failure
- Location data normalization across providers
- Accuracy confidence scoring per provider

2. Compliance Validation Rules
- Geographic boundary verification 
- Location accuracy thresholds
- VPN/proxy detection and rejection
- Historical location pattern analysis

## Check-in Flow (Importance Score: 75/100)
Two-phase location compliance verification:

1. Initial Check
- Real-time GPS coordinate capture
- Boundary polygon validation
- Accuracy radius assessment
- Time window verification

2. Secondary Validation
- IP-based location cross-reference
- Provider data correlation
- Deviation threshold checking
- Compliance status determination

Core files:
- `app/geo.py`: Location service integration and verification logic
- `app/templates/checkin.html`: Location capture interface
- `app/templates/admin_last_area.html`: Location monitoring dashboard

